Expose the existing PL AXI SPI controller on Fishball JP5's 1.8 V bank-35
pins for an ADF4159: SCLK, MOSI/DATA, active-low SS/LE and optional MUXOUT.
Expose EMIO GPIO 17 as TXDATA. Correct the bank-35 single-ended I/O standards
from the inherited LVCMOS25 to LVCMOS18, matching the schematic's VCC1V8.
The device-tree node makes the existing controller available as spidev.

